# tally 2.2.1 (S-231.Q2, #231), L §8.3 LOAD-INSTANT: "a pin of balance reading <x> states no instant": a pin of
# opening or stated is refused at load (a what-if balance is a scenario's row); a pin of a plain reading is read as
# before. tally 2.2's refcore stopped with AttributeError (the review's m3/review-probes/g1/rs5).
=== b.tally
model rb
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q5: bal(sav, 2026-02-28) with opening[sav] = 7 PLN

version v
  cite card
  governs 2026-01..2026-02
  known 2026-03-05
  anchor konto
  opening[konto] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start "base"
  stated[konto] = 100 at 2026-02-28 end "base"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-INSTANT a pin of balance reading opening states no instant (b.tally:12)
